{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4yC4vYWrErq9qo8jJh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism shifts. Tumblers align with a resonant click that echoes through stone corridors.*\n\n*I swing inward — slowly, heavily — revealing what lies beyond.*\n\n*Cold air rushes past. A faint light pulses from within.*\n\n**You may pass.**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":66,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}